{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#card-zh","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry（DSH 插件）：模型网关因容量不足返回 429 或冷却提示时，它会解析等待时间，在设定范围内等候并重试，按 turn 和 provider 管理次数。它也能在近期容量冷却后，用独立预算处理特定模态不支持 400。等待可取消，并写入会话以显示倒计时；`/cooldown-retry` 可查统计，另有动态浮动徽标。适合使用共享模型网关、希望冷却后自动恢复请求的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js 22 和 DSH timer 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:11-27","index.js:685-708","index.js:714-761","index.js:826-845","dynamic/client.js:46-59"]}
{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#card-en","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry waits for model gateway cooldown hints before retrying capacity failures. It tracks turn and provider budgets, handles a specific modality 400 after recent cooldown, and journals waits for countdown cards. Requires Node.js 22 and DSH timer service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:11-27","index.js:685-708","index.js:714-761","index.js:826-845","dynamic/client.js:46-59"]}
