{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#feature-1","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry 的功能「按上游提示重试」：识别容量类失败及重试延时，限制等待范围后等待并重试；支持错误字段、秒或毫秒提示和正文表达。默认每 turn/provider 最多重试 5 次。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:214-249","index.js:714-761"]}
{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#feature-2","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry 的功能「处理特定模态 400」：同一 provider 最近发生容量冷却后，将特定模态不支持 400 视为可能的熔断重放，并用独立预算等待后重试；没有近期冷却证据时委托后续处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:160-168","index.js:772-824"]}
{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#feature-3","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry 的功能「查看重试统计」：commands 服务可用时注册 `/cooldown-retry`，显示本轮和累计等待、重试、放弃次数及 provider 统计。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:400-413","index.js:826-838"]}
{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#feature-4","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry 的功能「显示重试倒计时」：等待前写入 llm/retry 记录，完成后配对 started 记录，使控制台可展示正在等待的重试卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:494-599","index.js:750-761"]}
{"unit_id":"dboycht__dsh-cooldown-retry#feature-5","repo":"dboycht/dsh-cooldown-retry","commit":"0cf066fa655a398287bc78a87751ef9f75d2cbd4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cooldown-retry 的功能「动态浮动倒计时徽标」：动态 client 每 500 毫秒查询 host 的 retry-status，在 shell.overlay 中显示等待状态、重试次数和剩余秒数。","source":"generated","evidence":["dynamic/host.js:80-93","dynamic/client.js:34-59"]}
